souc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FaOnOaq_wFymmeyFznMgkw","review_id":"1wBzcVqkqLmf9eRrlR_Z7A","date":"2016-01-29T14:31:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9410889744758606,"text_excerpt":"Two words. Fried Chicken. Forget that it's a convenient store/gas station. So...it's on Rampart and prob not the best of areas. I've never let a little bit of surrounding criminal activity keep me from trying some tasty fried chicken! My daughter and I walked there without incident and were greeted by a friendly man working the register and a sweet lady behind the chicken counter. We got 4 fried chicken breasts (bone in) and 4 slices of white bread (they were out of rolls). We had about a 10 min walk back and we ate the entire way. The chicken was hot, fresh, juicy, crispy and seasoned. Everything fried chicken ought to be. It was good, very good. I want some more."},{"business_id":"FaOnOaq_wFymmeyFznMgkw","review_id":"LFGEtvWpBkGMggNNJ9UBSw","date":"2011-05-03T14:19:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388374090194702,"text_excerpt":"This place has AWESOME fried chicken. Its hot and crispy and maybe just a little too greasy (in a good way). Deliciously seasoned, and certainly not overpriced (because hey, it comes from a gas station), this chicken will throw your brain a curveball, because who would have thought such great fried chicken would come from such an unsual locale."},{"business_id":"FaOnOaq_wFymmeyFznMgkw","review_id":"Q16KjxlO2WKpgwCGRJsWJA","date":"2011-05-03T16:01:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316689968109131,"text_excerpt":"When pulling into this local, shall I say scetchy looking, gas station, you think to yourself \"Wow this place is scetchy\" and then almost get run over by a taxi. The fried chicken there tastes homemade and has a great flavor to it. Many napkins are needed as the grease is running off of it. The fries are a great addition, but not necessary, if you are watching your fat or cholesterol. We also tried the meat pie, which tasted like a meat pie. Lots of flavor, nice crust and a good fuzzy feeling inside after you eat it. Definately a must try for those in the area."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FaOnOaq_wFymmeyFznMgkw","photo_id":"Q5qD9Cic2gPbhKlsIYnQrQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Q5qD9Cic2gPbhKlsIYnQrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
